      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Applicability\n\n- Use the Composite pattern when you have to implement a tree-like object structure.\n\n-  Use the pattern when you want the client code to treat both simple and complex \nelements uniformly.",
      "fontSize": 29.79547481958467,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Applicability\n\n- Use the Composite pattern when you have to implement a tree-like object structure.\n\n-  Use the pattern when you want the client code to treat both simple and complex \nelements uniformly.",
