      "updated": 1745055818874,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Applicability\n\n-  Use the Facade pattern when you need to have a limited but straightforward \ninterface to a complex subsystem.\n\n-  Use the Facade when you want to structure a subsystem into layers.",
      "fontSize": 29.79547481958467,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Applicability\n\n-  Use the Facade pattern when you need to have a limited but straightforward \ninterface to a complex subsystem.\n\n-  Use the Facade when you want to structure a subsystem into layers.",
