      "updated": 1745216566883,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Applicability\n\n- Use the Command pattern when you want to parametrize objects with operations.\n- Use the Command pattern when you want to queue operations, schedule their execution, or\nexecute them remotely.\n- Use the Command pattern when you want to implement reversible operations.",
      "fontSize": 29.79547481958467,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Applicability\n\n- Use the Command pattern when you want to parametrize objects with operations.\n- Use the Command pattern when you want to queue operations, schedule their execution, or execute them remotely.\n- Use the Command pattern when you want to implement reversible operations.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
