      ],
      "updated": 1745453311696,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Applicability\n\n- Use the Observer pattern when changes to the state of one object may require changing\nother objects, and the actual set of objects is unknown beforehand or changes\ndynamically.\n- Use the pattern when some objects in your app must observe others, but only for a\nlimited time or in specific cases.",
      "fontSize": 29.79547481958467,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Applicability\n\n- Use the Observer pattern when changes to the state of one object may require changing other objects, and the actual set of objects is unknown beforehand or changes dynamically.\n- Use the pattern when some objects in your app must observe others, but only for a limited time or in specific cases.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
